# Spec amendments — {{PROJECT_TITLE}} design pass

Gaps this design pass found in the upstream spec ({{SPEC_PATH}}), each with
the resolution already adopted in the design system and the exact spec
section to amend. Two states, tracked separately:

- **adopted** — the resolution is in force in this tree (DESIGN.md/TOKENS.md
  and the renders follow it).
- **landed** — the upstream spec file itself has been edited, in place, with
  a pointer back to this file. An amendment is not done until it is landed;
  a "recommended" note in this side file is not an accepted spec change.

Entry format:

```markdown
## N. <title> — §<target section>

**What the spec says:** <quote or faithful paraphrase>

**The gap (found round N, <lens> lens):** <the contradiction or hole, argued
from the spec's own text>

**Resolution already adopted:** <what this tree does instead, with values>

**Recommended spec change:** <the exact edit, ready to land>

**Source:** DECISIONS.md round N; <other artifacts>
```

